  "body": "If you have been looking for space without losing your privacy, this modern home is a must-see. Sitting on an elevated 503sqm section, the property backs straight onto a native bush area.\r\n\r\n• Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area with seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\n• Contemporary kitchen featuring a generous island bench, walk-in pantry, and ample storage.\r\n\r\n• Elevated outdoor setting with Kwila deck and peaceful native reserve views.\r\n\r\n• Ground floor includes two bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a separate living room, ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers, or work-from-home, with excellent granny potential.\r\n\r\n• Upstairs features a private master with ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and bush views, plus three additional bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a study nook.\r\n\r\nThe location gives you the very best of local living. You are just a quick drive away from the Silverdale shopping center, local cafés, top schools, the motorway on-ramp, and the beach.\r\n\r\nCall us today for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
